 <title>Offering my help as translator</title>
 <link>http://2010.drupalcamp.es/en/forum/english-forum/offering-my-help-translator</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello English speakers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am bilingual and have no trouble switching from Spanish to English, so I can help you find your way around, or help you ask the organizers, ask for a cold beer, find out where is an ATM, or help you ask that cute girl/guy out...  :D&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So if you see me around (see &lt;a href=&quot;http://drupalcamp.es/users/manuee&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;my profile&lt;/a&gt; for a picture), don&#039;t hesitate to ask anything you want in English, or just chat away!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
